@startuml
title Component diagram: gesture control subsystem

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Video source" as Video
component "HandDetector\n(MediaPipe wrapper)" as Detector
component "StaticGestureClassifier" as Static
component "TrajectoryBuffer" as Buffer
component "DynamicGestureClassifier" as Dynamic
component "CommandMapper" as Mapper
component "CommandSender" as Sender

Video --> Detector : frames
Detector --> Static : 21 landmarks
Detector --> Buffer : palm/index trajectory
Buffer --> Dynamic : 30-frame window
Static --> Mapper : GesturePrediction
Dynamic --> Mapper : GesturePrediction
Mapper --> Sender : CommandEvent

note right of Dynamic
Baseline heuristic classifier now.
LSTM/1D-CNN will reuse the
same trajectory contract.
end note

@enduml
